WEBVTT

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:10.985
Choose Upload in the side menu.

00:00:11.235 --> 00:00:17.235
Click Choose videos.

00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:27.191
Choose a file from your computer,
named "flaky_lesson.mp4".

00:00:28.045 --> 00:00:32.939
Wait until you see Retry.

00:00:33.189 --> 00:00:37.652
Click Retry flaky_lesson.mp4.

00:00:37.902 --> 00:00:43.902
Wait until you see Uploaded just now.
